{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2026-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1780876800, "end_date": 1781567999, "month_true_total": 79, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:03:21 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "228062251", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067806722", "personaname": "Solitude", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198067806722/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 49, "playtime_forever": 1433, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1433, "last_played": 1781564561, "avatar": "d5961c6a268615f1b41efad140ff268b5a021438"}, "language": "english", "review": "Huge downgrade from first trilogy. Horrible writting, gameplay is clunky (movement, shooting, and menu functions), missions are designed to increase playtime. \r\nIn order to equip anything you have to select your loadout outside of each mission area even though its openworld and you are picking up things as you play. Feels slapped together by people who dont play games. Avoid this and just enjoy the original trilogy, wouldn't be surprised if the next reboot or instalment skips this entirly.", "timestamp_created": 1781564907, "timestamp_updated": 1781564907, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 12, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.586714506149291992", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228008153", "author": {"steamid": "76561198867858983", "personaname": "Devilsbacon9229", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198867858983/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 6305, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1028, "last_played": 1785143022, "avatar": "3604ac34b47c87e187d151f22aa17e107253ce34"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game! Never played the ones before it. But its a lot of fun. Love the team building and combat. Settling Andromeda and being Pathfinder is a lot of fun.", "timestamp_created": 1781506358, "timestamp_updated": 1781506358, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.508771896362304688", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "227998263", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999071624", "personaname": "Gale", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197999071624/", "num_games_owned": 496, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 179, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 179, "deck_playtime_at_review": 98, "last_played": 1781490376, "avatar": "a41301d4b9e1d39dda8f88f1c057b74f846482c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've barely played the game, but it is so incredibly nerve grating that I'm not sure if I can continue. The actual combat seems pretty fun, what little I've done at least. But the writing, the characters, the story. It's all terrible. Voice actors that sound like their doing their first gig, writing that makes no sense, and characters that are incredibly boring and uninteresting. \nThe original Mass Effect trilogy wasn't always a shining beacon of writing competency. But it always made sense and it was always competent.", "timestamp_created": 1781490612, "timestamp_updated": 1781490612, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.4872455894947052", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "227924039", "author": {"ste